  "prefLabel": "Puc 1107.07 E-23 Report of Interruptions of Service",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1107.07 E-23 Report of Interruptions of Service.\n\n(a) Each utility shall file Form E-23 monthly with the commission which shall report interruptions of service.\n\n(b) Utilities shall include on form E-23 the following:\n\n(1) Date;\n\n(2) Time of interruption including start, end and total elapsed time;\n\n(3) Location;\n\n(4) Number of customers; and\n\n(5) Cause of interruption.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter heading Puc 1100) #6445, eff 1-28-97; ss and moved by #8244, eff 12-31-04 (from Puc 1107.09); ss by #10307, eff 4-9-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc1100.html"
